# Code owners for gating files only. A file listed here
# judges or gates a merge or a deploy, so the owner approves it. Every other
# file is unowned: an agent PR touching only those merges on the reviewer App's
# approval. There is deliberately no catch-all line, and none may be added.
# GitHub matches case-sensitively and has no character classes, so a name word
# is listed in its lower-case, Capitalised and UPPER-case spellings. Check an
# edit with the codeowners/errors API: an empty list is the only signal that
# every entry resolved (an owner without write access is dropped silently).

# CI workflows, actions and CI config: they decide pass or fail on every PR.
/.github/                                        @branchLeft/branchleft-admin
**/.github/workflows/                            @branchLeft/branchleft-admin
**/.github/actions/                              @branchLeft/branchleft-admin

# CODEOWNERS and ruleset or branch-protection files: they say who must approve.
**/CODEOWNERS                                    @branchLeft/branchleft-admin
**/codeowners                                    @branchLeft/branchleft-admin
**/CodeOwners                                    @branchLeft/branchleft-admin
**/*ruleset*                                     @branchLeft/branchleft-admin
**/*Ruleset*                                     @branchLeft/branchleft-admin
**/*RULESET*                                     @branchLeft/branchleft-admin
**/*branch-protection*                           @branchLeft/branchleft-admin
**/*Branch-Protection*                           @branchLeft/branchleft-admin
**/*BRANCH-PROTECTION*                           @branchLeft/branchleft-admin
**/*branch_protection*                           @branchLeft/branchleft-admin
**/*Branch_Protection*                           @branchLeft/branchleft-admin
**/*BRANCH_PROTECTION*                           @branchLeft/branchleft-admin
**/*branchprotection*                            @branchLeft/branchleft-admin
**/*BranchProtection*                            @branchLeft/branchleft-admin
**/*BRANCHPROTECTION*                            @branchLeft/branchleft-admin

