# branchLeft/standards templates/codeowners, synced whole (SYNC-1: these six
# lines must be this file's final lines, in this order — GitHub applies the
# LAST matching CODEOWNERS pattern regardless of specificity, so anything
# after or between them would silently take ownership of an escape hatch).
/.standardsignore        @branchLeft/branchleft-admin
/.standards.mode         @branchLeft/branchleft-admin
/.docs-lint*             @branchLeft/branchleft-admin
/tools/floors.tsv        @branchLeft/branchleft-admin
/.standards-db-tooling   @branchLeft/branchleft-admin
/.github/                @branchLeft/branchleft-admin
